// MemorySSA Dependence Classification, Store-to-Load Forwarding, Redundant Load Elimination (RLE),
// Dead Store Elimination (DSE), and Memory Intrinsic Rewrites over Capability-Aware AliasInfo (T606 / E15.2).
// Implements SPEC-71 §1.7-§1.8 & §3.6-§3.7 (AXS-ALIAS-006, AXS-ESC-016, AXS-ESC-017) & SPEC-70 (AXS-OPT-022):
//   - 17-kind `MemAccessKind` classification (`REQ-OPT-365`)
//   - 4-value `MemDependence` (`NoDepend`, `MustDepend`, `MayDepend`, `UnknownDepend`)
//   - Store-to-load forwarding & `view<T>` redundant load elimination (`REQ-OPT-366`, `REQ-OPT-301`)
//   - Post-dominating overwrite & dead local store elimination (`REQ-OPT-366`)
//   - Strict barrier preservation: atomic (`REQ-OPT-312`), volatile/MMIO (`REQ-OPT-313`),
//     foreign/FFI (`REQ-OPT-314`), zero-copy/DMA pin (`REQ-OPT-347`), `Drop`, `zeroize`, panic/unwind
//   - `memmove -> memcpy` (`ptr_copy -> ptr_copy_nonoverlapping`) & `memset` zero-init legality
module compiler.opt.memopt

